            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Style</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">Style</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Stile</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-slate-300">
            <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">不讲术语，先交付结果</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Pas de jargon, priorité aux résultats</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">No jargon, results first</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Niente gergo, risultati prima</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 bg-white/5">
          <div class="text-white font-semibold">
            <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">对象</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Clients</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">Clients</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Clienti</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-slate-300">
            <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">欧洲华侨企业/跨境团队</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Entreprises chinoises en Europe</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">Overseas Chinese businesses in Europe</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Imprese cinesi in Europa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 bg-white/5">
          <div class="text-white font-semibold">
            <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">核心能力</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Atouts</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">Strengths</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Punti di forza</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-slate-300">
            <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">客户体验 + 流程落地 + 增长复盘</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="fr">Expérience client + exécution + croissance</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="en">Customer experience + execution + growth</span>
            <span data-lang-inline="it">Esperienza cliente + esecuzione + crescita</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Chat anchor -->
  <section id="chat" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-14">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 p-8 glass shadow-soft">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold">
        <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">现在就开始（最快方式）</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="fr">Commencer maintenant (le plus simple)</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="en">Start now (fastest way)</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="it">Inizia ora (modo più veloce)</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">
        <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">用三句话介绍你的业务和目标。ZSJ 的 AI 助手可以帮你梳理<span class="text-white font-semibold">从哪里开始、30 天内可以做什么</span>。</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="fr">Présentez votre activité et vos objectifs en trois phrases. L’assistant IA de ZSJ peut vous aider à déterminer <span class="text-white font-semibold">par où commencer et ce qui est réalisable en 30 jours</span>.</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="en">Describe your business and goals in three sentences. ZSJ’s AI assistant can help you explore <span class="text-white font-semibold">where to start and what’s achievable in 30 days</span>.</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="it">Descrivi la tua attività e i tuoi obiettivi in tre frasi. L’assistente IA di ZSJ può aiutarti a capire <span class="text-white font-semibold">da dove iniziare e cosa è possibile fare in 30 giorni</span>.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 text-sm text-slate-200">
        <div class="font-semibold text-white">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">咨询模板</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Modèle de message</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">Message template</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Modello di messaggio</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" id="zsj-intake-template">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">1）我的企业类型：行业/主要业务（简单说）<br/>
          2）当前最影响增长的问题：获客/服务/交付/协作（选1-2个）<br/>
          3）团队人数 + 希望1个月达成的结果：</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">1) Type d’entreprise / activité principale<br/>
          2) Problème principal : acquisition / service / livraison / collaboration<br/>
          3) Taille de l’équipe + résultat attendu en 30 jours :</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">1) Business type / main activity<br/>
          2) Biggest blocker: acquisition / service / delivery / collaboration<br/>
          3) Team size + outcome you want in 30 days:</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">1) Tipo di impresa / attività principale<br/>
          2) Blocco principale: acquisizione / servizio / consegna / collaborazione<br/>
          3) Dimensione team + obiettivo in 30 giorni:</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="zsj-copy-template" class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-white/20 px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-white/10">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">复制模板</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Copier le modèle</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">Copy template</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Copia il modello</span>
        </button>
        <span id="zsj-copy-status" class="ml-2 text-slate-300" role="status"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">请用概括或脱敏示例说明需求，避免在聊天中发送敏感资料。</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="fr">Décrivez votre besoin en termes généraux ou avec des exemples anonymisés.</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="en">Describe your needs in general terms or with anonymized examples.</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="it">Descrivi le tue esigenze in termini generali o con esempi anonimizzati.</span>
      </p>
      <button class="mt-5 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-950 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 btn"
        type="button" data-zsj-chat-open aria-controls="zsj-chat-panel" aria-haspopup="dialog">
        <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">打开聊天窗口</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="fr">Ouvrir le chat</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="en">Open chat</span>
        <span data-lang-inline="it">Apri chat</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold" tabindex="-1">
      <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">FAQ</span>
      <span data-lang-inline="fr">FAQ</span>
      <span data-lang-inline="en">FAQ</span>
      <span data-lang-inline="it">FAQ</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 glass shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-white font-semibold">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">你到底交付什么？</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Que livrez‑vous exactement ?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">What exactly do you deliver?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Cosa consegni esattamente?</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">我交付的是“可用系统”：客户接待与跟进流程、统一话术与资料、团队交接文档。</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Un système opérationnel : accueil client, suivi, messages cohérents, documentation d’équipe.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">An operational system: customer handling, follow‑ups, consistent messaging, and team docs.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Un sistema operativo: gestione clienti, follow‑up, messaggi coerenti, documentazione.</span>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 glass shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-white font-semibold">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">需要我团队懂技术吗？</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Faut‑il une équipe technique ?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">Does my team need to be technical?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Serve un team tecnico?</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">不需要。你只要提供业务信息；我会把流程写成简单说明，并做一次交接培训。</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Non. Vous fournissez les infos métier, je rends l’usage simple et formé.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">No. You provide business info, I make it simple and train your team.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">No. Fornisci le info business, io semplifico e formo il team.</span>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 glass shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-white font-semibold">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">资料隐私怎么处理？</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Et la confidentialité ?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">How about privacy?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">E la privacy?</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">默认最小化采集与分级权限；敏感资料可用“字段清单+样例”方式描述。</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Collecte minimale, accès par niveaux ; données sensibles via liste de champs.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">Minimal collection, tiered access; sensitive data via field lists.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Raccolta minima, accessi a livelli; dati sensibili via lista campi.</span>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 glass shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-white font-semibold">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">你适合谁？不适合谁？</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Pour qui est‑ce adapté ?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">Who is this for?</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Per chi è adatto?</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">适合：想转型落地、重视客户体验、愿意优化流程的企业。<br/>
          不适合：只想做展示、不愿整理资料或不愿改变流程的团队。</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">Adapté aux entreprises prêtes à améliorer l’expérience client et leurs processus. Pas pour un simple “showroom IA”.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">For companies ready to improve customer experience and processes, not just a demo.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">Per aziende pronte a migliorare esperienza cliente e processi, non solo una demo.</span>
        </p>
      </details>
{{extraFaq}}
    </div>
  </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer id="wechat" class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-10 pb-24 md:pb-10 text-sm text-slate-400">
      <span class="zsj-wechat-contact">
        <a class="zsj-wechat-image" href="/assets/wechat-qr.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <img src="/assets/wechat-qr.png" width="740" height="740" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{wechatEnlarge}}" />
        </a>
        <span class="zsj-wechat-copy">
          <strong>{{wechatLabel}}</strong>
          <span>{{wechatHelp}}</span>
        </span>
      </span>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
        <div>© <span id="y"></span> ZSJ. All rights reserved.</div>
        <div class="text-xs">
          <span data-lang-inline="zh-CN">聊天消息由 OpenAI 处理以生成回复。</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="fr">OpenAI traite les messages du chat pour générer les réponses.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="en">OpenAI processes chat messages to generate replies.</span>
          <span data-lang-inline="it">OpenAI elabora i messaggi della chat per generare le risposte.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
{{analyticsPrivacy}}
    </div>
  </footer>

  <aside id="analytics-consent" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="analytics-heading"
    class="fixed bottom-20 left-4 right-4 z-50 max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900 p-5 text-slate-100 shadow-soft">
    <h2 id="analytics-heading" class="text-lg font-semibold">{{analyticsHeading}}</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-200">{{analyticsNotice}}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="underline underline-offset-4">{{analyticsPolicy}}</a>
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button id="analytics-accept" type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-400 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800">{{analyticsAccept}}</button>
      <button id="analytics-refuse" type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-400 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800">{{analyticsRefuse}}</button>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="zsj-chat" hidden>
    <button type="button" class="zsj-chat-launcher" id="zsj-chat-launcher" data-zsj-chat-open
      aria-controls="zsj-chat-panel" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog">
      <span class="zsj-chat-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span data-chat-label="launcher"></span>
    </button>
    <section class="zsj-chat-panel" id="zsj-chat-panel" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="zsj-chat-title" hidden>
      <header class="zsj-chat-header">
        <span class="zsj-chat-mark" aria-hidden="true">ZSJ</span>
        <h2 id="zsj-chat-title" data-chat-label="title" tabindex="-1"></h2>
        <button type="button" id="zsj-chat-close" class="zsj-chat-close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
        </button>
      </header>
      <div class="zsj-chat-log" id="zsj-chat-log" role="log" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="zsj-chat-title">
        <p class="zsj-chat-message zsj-chat-message-assistant" data-chat-label="welcome" id="zsj-chat-welcome"></p>
      </div>
      <form class="zsj-chat-form" id="zsj-chat-form">
        <p class="zsj-chat-status" id="zsj-chat-status" role="status"></p>
        <a class="zsj-chat-faq" id="zsj-chat-faq" href="#faq" data-chat-label="faq" hidden></a>
        <label for="zsj-chat-message" class="zsj-chat-sr-only" data-chat-label="message"></label>
        <div class="zsj-chat-controls">
          <textarea id="zsj-chat-message" name="message" rows="2" maxlength="1000"
            aria-describedby="zsj-chat-notice"></textarea>
          <button type="submit" class="zsj-chat-send" id="zsj-chat-send" disabled></button>
        </div>
        <p class="zsj-chat-notice" id="zsj-chat-notice" data-chat-label="notice"></p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('y').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
